WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.500
The first dash starts after the light-Arrow knockdown.

2
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:00.900
Jamie completes the second dash as Ken rises.

3
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.400
Standing medium punch hits Ken.

4
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.150
Standing light punch starts the target-combo link.

5
00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.150
The medium-punch target follow-up connects.

6
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:05.250
Light Arrow Kick continues the juggle.
